  m_text: "What are Hong Kong's languages?,Chinese and English,Spanish,French,Japanese\r\nWhat
    is Hong Kong's money?,Hong Kong Dollar,Chinese Yuan,US Dollar,Euro\r\nWhen did
    Hong Kong return to China?,1997,1987,2000,1990\r\nWhat is Hong Kong's tallest
    building?,International Commerce Centre,Eiffel Tower,Burj Khalifa,Empire State
    Building\r\nWhat type of government does Hong Kong have?,Special Administrative
    Region,Monarchy,Republic,Dictatorship\r\nWhat is Hong Kong's famous harbor?,Victoria
    Harbour,Bay of Bengal,Marina Bay,Halong Bay\r\nWhat is Hong Kong's airport called?,Hong
    Kong International Airport,Beijing Airport,Changi Airport,Heathrow Airport\r\nWhere
    can you see Hong Kong's skyline?,Victoria Peak,Mount Everest,The Alps,Table Mountain\r\nWhat
    is a common Hong Kong dish?,Dim Sum,Sushi,Pizza,Tacos\r\nWhat is Hong Kong's
    train system?,MTR,Subway,BART,MetroLink\r\nWhat is the main religion in Hong
    Kong?,Buddhism,Christianity,Hinduism,Islam\r\nWhat theme park is in Hong Kong?,Hong
    Kong Disneyland,Universal Studios,Ocean World,SeaWorld\r\nWhen was Hong Kong's
    Basic Law made?,1990,1995,1987,2000\r\nWhat is the street with celebrity statues?,Avenue
    of Stars,Hollywood Boulevard,Walk of Fame,Times Square\r\nWhat is the traditional
    Hong Kong boat?,Junk Boat,Cruise Ship,Fishing Trawler,Yacht\r\nWhat is Hong Kong's
    main business?,Finance,Agriculture,Oil Mining,Automobile Manufacturing\r\nWhen
    are dragon boat races held?,Dragon Boat Festival,Mid-Autumn Festival,Qingming
    Festival,New Year Festival\r\nWhat is Hong Kong's population (2023)?,7.5 million,3
    million,12 million,20 million\r\nWhere is Hong Kong's main shopping area?,Causeway
    Bay,Times Square,Oxford Street,Shibuya\r\nWhat is the famous street market?,Temple
    Street Night Market,Chinatown Night Market,Silk Market,Souk Market\r\nWhich country
    ruled Hong Kong before 1997?,United Kingdom,France,Japan,United States\r\nWhat
    is the ferry in Hong Kong called?,Star Ferry,Golden Ferry,Blue Ferry,Dragon Ferry\r\nWhat
    is the big Buddha in Hong Kong called?,Tian Tan Buddha,Great Buddha,Statue of
    Liberty,Christ the Redeemer\r\nWhat is Hong Kong's finance area?,Central,Mid-Levels,Kowloon
    City,Stanley\r\nWhere is Hong Kong's airport?,Lantau Island,Hong Kong Island,Kowloon,Cheung
    Chau\r\nWhat is the horse racing track?,Happy Valley Racecourse,Wembley Stadium,Epsom
    Downs Racecourse,Ascot\r\nWhat sea is near Hong Kong?,South China Sea,East China
    Sea,Yellow Sea,Philippine Sea\r\nWhat is Hong Kong's longest bridge?,Tsing Ma
    Bridge,Golden Gate Bridge,Tower Bridge,Brooklyn Bridge\r\nWhat do the stars on
    Hong Kong's flag stand for?,China,The United States,The British Empire,Europe\r\nWhat
    is Hong Kong's main transport?,MTR,Bus,Tram,Taxi\r\nWhat is Hong Kong's Chinese
    name?,Heung Gong,Shang Hai,Bei Jing,Cheng Du\r\nWhat does \"Hong Kong\" mean?,Fragrant
    Harbor,Beautiful Island,Golden City,Dragon Harbor\r\nWhat is Hong Kong's light
    show called?,Symphony of Lights,Northern Lights,Illuminations,Light Festival\r\nWhat
    is Hong Kong's largest island?,Lantau Island,Hong Kong Island,Cheung Chau,Lamma
    Island\r\nWhat is the famous temple in Hong Kong?,Man Mo Temple,Angkor Wat,Temple
    of Heaven,Sensoji Temple\r\nWhat is the drinking age in Hong Kong?,18,16,21,20\r\nWhat
    is Hong Kong's favorite sport?,Soccer,Cricket,Basketball,Baseball\r\nWhat is
    Hong Kong's big art event?,Hong Kong Arts Festival,Sydney Festival,Venice Biennale,Edinburgh
    Fringe Festival\r\nWhat is the outdoor escalator called?,Central\uE806id-Levels
    Escalator,Systematic Escalators,City Escalator,Tsim Sha Tsui Escalator\r\nWhat
    is Hong Kong's weather?,Subtropical,Tropical,Arid,Mediterranean\r\nWhere are
    Hong Kong's neon streets?,Mong Kok,Central,Mid-Levels,Stanley\r\nWhat is Hong
    Kong's famous hotel?,The Peninsula,The Ritz,The Plaza,Burj Al Arab\r\nWhat is
    Hong Kong's tech park?,Cyberport,Silicon Valley,Tech City,Smart City\r\nWhere
    does Hong Kong get water?,Imported from China,Rainwater,Rivers,Groundwater\r\nWhat
    festival has lanterns?,Mid-Autumn Festival,Spring Festival,Dragon Boat Festival,Qingming
    Festival\r\nWhat animal is lucky in Hong Kong?,Dragon,Dolphin,Eagle,Elephant\r\nWhat
    is Hong Kong's famous hiking trail?,Dragon's Back,Appalachian Trail,Great Wall
    Trail,Inca Trail\r\nWhat is Hong Kong's biggest university?,The University of
    Hong Kong,Oxford University,Stanford University,National University of Singapore\r\nWhat
    is the floating restaurant called?,Jumbo Floating Restaurant,Golden Pavilion,Floating
    Palace,Seafood Paradise\r\nWhat is the famous clock tower?,Tsim Sha Tsui Clock
    Tower,Big Ben,Chinatown Clock,Victoria Clock"
